  "description": "Tryit.Configure is a lightweight .NET library for file-based JSON configuration management. It lets applications read and write configuration values by key path, automatically create missing JSON nodes, reload settings from disk, and optionally watch configuration files for external changes. The project also includes reusable JSON helper functionality for serialization and file operations, making it suitable for small to medium applications that need a simple and practical configuration solution.",
